<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<odoo noupdate="1">

    <!-- Nursery bareroot dormancy window (GOL-1906, Josh 2026-09-07: "we should
         be able to toggle these dates in odoo").

         Bareroot ships ONLY inside this window: outside it a bareroot line
         cannot buy a shipping label and becomes a preorder deposit (see
         shipping_boxes.can_ship_bareroot and its callers). Because the window
         now gates REVENUE, the dates must be a nursery-manager knob, not a code
         constant + deploy — a season that opens a week early is an Odoo edit.

         Format is MM-DD (month-day, NO year): the window wraps the year end
         (Nov 1 -> Apr 15), which packing_mode handles as `t >= start or t <= end`;
         a year would break the wrap. shipping_boxes.parse_window validates these
         on read and FAILS CLOSED (raises) on a malformed / year-bearing / equal
         (empty) value — it never silently falls back to the seed, so a typo can
         never ship an underpriced label off a wrong window.

         Seeded from the ratified Nov 1 – Apr 15 default; noupdate="1" so a
         nursery-manager edit in Odoo (Settings > Technical > System Parameters)
         survives module upgrades. Mirrors the noupdate handling of
         grove_headless.preorder_cap_default (GOL-2171). Kept in its own seed
         file (not grove_config_params.xml) so this PR and the preorder-cap PR
         seed their params without a shared-file merge conflict; consolidating
         the two files is a trivial follow-up once both have landed. -->
    <record id="dormancy_start_param" model="ir.config_parameter">
        <field name="key">grove_headless.dormancy_start</field>
        <field name="value">11-01</field>
    </record>
    <record id="dormancy_end_param" model="ir.config_parameter">
        <field name="key">grove_headless.dormancy_end</field>
        <field name="value">04-15</field>
    </record>

</odoo>
